{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Autumn's Dungeoneering - Early Access</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ever wondered what it\u2019s like to be the hero\u2019s pet?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <i>Autumn\u2019s Dungeoneering</i>, a top-down RPG where you\u2019re not the hero\u2014you\u2019re a summoned companion supporting adventurers in deadly dungeons. Your mission: keep them alive while facing the question, <i>\u201cAm I truly needed?\u201d</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong><i><u>Story Mode</u></i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as the Pet</strong>: Control a divine water spirit with unique abilities.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watch &amp; Learn</strong>: Watch as your adventurer conquers dungeons autonomously.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Study Companion Behavior</strong>: Observe how personality-driven adventurers make independent decisions and develop strategies.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Dynamic Gameplay</u></i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tab-Targeting Combat</strong>: Click on an enemy, choose the skill from the hotbar.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elemental Mastery</strong>: Using the Xanrean elemental system, wield your primary and secondary elements for maximum effectiveness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic RPG Loop</strong>: Shop in town, tackle procedural dungeons, loot, and build relationships.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sophisticated Companion Partners</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Adventurers</strong>: Each adventurer will have unique personality and gameplay style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relationship Dynamics</strong>: As the pet, you will be at the mercy of your owner. You are expendable, they are not.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Modes</strong>: Support your autonomous adventurer as their pet in Story Mode, or observe their pure solo behavior in Idle Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Ready to prove you\u2019re more than a summon? Jump into Autumn\u2019s Dungeoneering and prove it!</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3403760?t=1755039436","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3403760?t=1755039436","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403760/548c5fc5e14a9c4612297751a828c3cbc1633a18/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755039436","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403760/548c5fc5e14a9c4612297751a828c3cbc1633a18/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755039436","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3404230,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Autumn's Dungeoneering - Early Access</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ever wondered what it\u2019s like to be the hero\u2019s pet?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <i>Autumn\u2019s Dungeoneering</i>, a top-down RPG where you\u2019re not the hero\u2014you\u2019re a summoned companion supporting adventurers in deadly dungeons. Your mission: keep them alive while facing the question, <i>\u201cAm I truly needed?\u201d</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong><i><u>Story Mode</u></i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as the Pet</strong>: Control a divine water spirit with unique abilities.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watch &amp; Learn</strong>: Watch as your adventurer conquers dungeons autonomously.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Study Companion Behavior</strong>: Observe how personality-driven adventurers make independent decisions and develop strategies.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Dynamic Gameplay</u></i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tab-Targeting Combat</strong>: Click on an enemy, choose the skill from the hotbar.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elemental Mastery</strong>: Using the Xanrean elemental system, wield your primary and secondary elements for maximum effectiveness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic RPG Loop</strong>: Shop in town, tackle procedural dungeons, loot, and build relationships.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sophisticated Companion Partners</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Adventurers</strong>: Each adventurer will have unique personality and gameplay style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relationship Dynamics</strong>: As the pet, you will be at the mercy of your owner. You are expendable, they are not.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Modes</strong>: Support your autonomous adventurer as their pet in Story Mode, or observe their pure solo behavior in Idle Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Ready to prove you\u2019re more than a summon? Jump into Autumn\u2019s Dungeoneering and prove it!</i></p>","developers":["Purple Xanmal"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403760/fec5e62689e7a088fed838845c620c0cc1be6d41/header.